@ Index:  Restore default settings after HP35fun
@ Author: Jaco Mostert
@ Tested: From cleared flags, sets SPCRES, CPXRES and eRPN.
@ Input:  SPCRES, CPXRES and eRPN cleared
@ Output: All three set to 1
LBL ‘47DEFLT’
  # SET THE USUAL SETTINGS WHEN COMING BACK FROM HP35fun Rev2
  CLRMOD
  CLSTK
  iLI/ℝ
  ALL 03
  SF ‘MyMb’
  CF ‘HOMEb’
  RNG 6145
  SDIGS 34
  dSTACK 04
  DEG
  SSIZE8
  SF ‘SPCRES’
  SF ‘CPXRES’
  SF ‘eRPN’
  SF ‘fg.FUL’
  IPGRP 03
  FPGRP 03
  IPGRP1 00
  IPGRP1x 00
  ISPC␣
  FSPC␣
  RPER.
  END
.END.
